@startuml
title Doctor CLI Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Canonical Python Package" {
  [CLI]
  [Diagnostic Orchestrator]
  [Check Registry]
  [Common Checks]
  [Report Model]
  [Text Renderer]
  [JSON Renderer]
  [Exit Code Mapper]
  [Logging]
}

package "Platform Adapters" {
  [Windows Adapter]
  [macOS Adapter]
  [Linux Adapter]
}

[CLI] --> [Diagnostic Orchestrator]
[Diagnostic Orchestrator] --> [Check Registry]
[Check Registry] --> [Common Checks]
[Check Registry] --> [Windows Adapter]
[Check Registry] --> [macOS Adapter]
[Check Registry] --> [Linux Adapter]
[Diagnostic Orchestrator] --> [Report Model]
[Diagnostic Orchestrator] --> [Exit Code Mapper]
[Diagnostic Orchestrator] --> [Logging]
[Report Model] --> [Text Renderer]
[Report Model] --> [JSON Renderer]

note bottom
Canonical distribution is the Python package.
Future standalone executables must derive
from the same source and architecture.
end note
@enduml
